    "facility": "Niagara Bottling Groveland plant, 7633 American Way, operating since 2007. Confirmed via Street View: building with bulk silos/storage tanks (bottling water tanks), gated entry. Located in a multi-tenant industrial park; the Niagara building is the standalone large building, distinct from neighboring warehouses.",
